{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sPYde9G9CR1795605779.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在維園舉行的中國網球巡迴賽香港公開賽正賽展開，港將王康怡女單首圈過關。</p><p></p><p>綠衫的王康怡面對中國球手劉樂怡，首盤先贏6-2。第二盤尾段，一輪底線拉鋸，王康怡轉向，令對方反應不及，再有機會破發。</p><p></p><p>賽事屬於中巡賽最高級別的CTA1000，連續四年在香港舉行，總獎金80萬人民幣。24歲的香港球手王康怡，尾段成功打破對方發球局，贏多盤6-4，直落晉級次圈。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T12:12:00.836209+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:54:58.723185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:22.232949+00:00","content_hash":"b34db9b6087f36038d19d18cb4bd3419c1c851d91c6c7442e5f4e5391a0948d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T12:12:00.836209+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}